40",").",[190,220,222],{"id":221},"chunk-size","Chunk size",[165,224,225,226,177],{},"If your variable is partitioned into chunks then here you will see the corresponding chunk dimensions. Chunking determines how much data is fetched per request — see ",[227,228,141],"a",{"href":142},[179,230,232],{"id":231},"sliders","Sliders",[165,234,235],{},"If your data is too big then a set of sliders for selection will be shown. Use those to select an appropriate range along each dimension before plotting.",[237,238,240],"callout",{"icon":239},"i-lucide-lightbulb","Slicing early keeps memory usage low: only the chunks that intersect your selected range are downloaded.",[179,242,243],{"id":176},"Plot",[165,245,246,247,249,250,254,255,177],{},"Click ",[174,248,176],{}," to render the selection. You can then change the ",[227,251,253],{"href":252},"\u002Fessentials\u002Fplot-settings","plot type"," or adjust the ",[227,256,258],{"href":257},"\u002Fessentials\u002Fcolorbar","colorbar",{"title":260,"searchDepth":261,"depth":261,"links":262},"",2,[263,269,270],{"id":181,"depth":261,"text":182,"children":264},[265,267,268],{"id":192,"depth":266,"text":193},3,{"id":210,"depth":266,"text":211},{"id":221,"depth":266,"text":222},{"id":231,"depth":261,"text":232},{"id":176,"depth":261,"text":243},"Select only data that fits.","md",null,{},{"icon":39},{"title":36,"description":271},"X6M1Y0azLWDvBmmuZ-aDKYu7z4-uZNs6XnQ99Uii30s",[279,281],{"title":31,"path":32,"stem":33,"description":280,"icon":34,"children":-1},"Load curated, remote, or local datasets.",{"title":41,"path":42,"stem":43,"description":282,"icon":44,"children":-1},"Every plot type and its dimension requirements.",1790773463955]